        "title": "Latkaeng dai “guang Nii Niimei ”",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Latkaeng daih “Guang nii niimei”",
            "Alung khou hei chu bam,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e;",
            "Ringhbamv tuang duiriang khou hei",
            "Ringhmei dui luangc bam e,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e.",
            "",
            "“Thow punic .. guang niimei”",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e!",
            "Guloumeipu kawmei hei",
            "ntaw nganv kaw bam e,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e!",
            "",
            "2 Ravguangc Lat khou gay chuymei",
            "Latchamv hei chupui sik,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e;",
            "Mi lat hei paapc mei khang e,",
            "Ai thay e akhang e;",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e!",
            "",
            "3 Ai chumei zianmei chamv hei",
            "Baihmei nunc khou dinc ni,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e;",
            "Guloumeipu ta phu o,",
            "Kamei Nang khang sw ni,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e!",
            "",
            "4 Ravguangc hym daihmei sw diu!",
            "KaNac ’Pouh ta tii the,",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e;",
            "Lwmna Kakhou guangmei ta",
            "Kamei gulou puni;",
            "Guang nii niimei guang nuh e!"
          ]
        }
      },
